          "description": "The arachne can cause the ground to erupt around her within a 30 ft. radius. Creatures within the area of effect take 8d6 points of earth damage and are inflicted with the Weighted status effect. All those in the area of effect must make a Reflex save (DC 26) for half damage and negating the status effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Nature DC 23).",
